  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>inequality-keys · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-inequality-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-inequality-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const valuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; values: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const zoneIdsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; zoneIds: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const weightsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; weights: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const valueKeysOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; valueKeys: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const rowIndicesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; rowIndices: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 791u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const ZONE_COUNT: u32 = 77u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const KNOT_COUNT: u32 = 11u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const STATS_STRIDE: u32 = 10u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn getScaledQuotient(value: f32, first: f32, second: f32, power: i32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  if (value == 0.0) { return value; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  let numerator = frexp(value);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  let firstDivisor = frexp(first);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let secondDivisor = frexp(second);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  let quotient = frexp(numerator.fract / (firstDivisor.fract * secondDivisor.fract));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  return ldexp(quotient.fract,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">    numerator.exp - firstDivisor.exp - secondDivisor.exp + power + quotient.exp);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">// WGSL rejects NaN constants, so build one from a runtime bit pattern.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">fn getNaN() -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  var bits = 0x7fc00000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(bits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">fn isFiniteBits(x: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(x) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">fn getOrderedKey(x: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  let bits = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  return select(bits ^ 0x80000000u, ~bits, (bits &amp; 0x80000000u) != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">fn interpolateLorenz(cut: f32, previousP: f32, nextP: f32, previousL: f32, nextL: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  if (cut &gt;= nextP) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    return nextL;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  return previousL + getScaledQuotient(cut - previousP, nextP - previousP, 1.0, 0) * (nextL - previousL);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"60\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"61\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  _ = &amp;values;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  _ = &amp;zoneIds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  _ = &amp;weights;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  _ = &amp;valueKeys;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  _ = &amp;rowIndices;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let value = values[valuesOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let zone = zoneIds[zoneIdsOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  var isValid = isFiniteBits(value) &amp;&amp; value &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; zone &lt; ZONE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  let weight = weights[weightsOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  isValid = isValid &amp;&amp; isFiniteBits(weight) &amp;&amp; weight &gt; 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  // Valid keys are below 0xff800000, so invalid rows sort after every valid row; -0 sorts as +0.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  valueKeys[valueKeysOffset + index] = select(0xffffffffu, getOrderedKey(select(value, 0.0, value == 0.0)), isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  rowIndices[rowIndicesOffset + index] = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>values<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"values\">values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>zoneIds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"zoneIds\">zoneIds</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>weights<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"weights\">weights</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>valueKeys<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"inequality-value-keys\">inequality-value-keys</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>rowIndices<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"inequality-row-indices\">inequality-row-indices</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUInequality/keys · main · 50c4af20</figcaption></figure></section>",
